---
---
<section class="py-20 bg-[#0A0B0D] border-t border-[#22252B]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-[#121316] border border-[#22252B] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Glow -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-lime/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime/10 border border-lime/20 text-lime text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
            <span>REAL-WORLD CASE STUDY</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            How Ramesh Secured a ₹50,000 Equipment Loan with Zero Bureau History
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Ramesh operates a high-volume tea and snack stall in Bengaluru, processing ₹42,000+ per month across 300+ micro-UPI transactions. Traditional banks rejected him because he had no salary slips or CIBIL score.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0A0B0D] border border-[#22252B] mb-6">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">Monthly UPI Turnover</p>
              <p class="num-mono text-lg font-bold text-white">₹42,995</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">Net Operating Surplus</p>
              <p class="num-mono text-lg font-bold text-lime">₹20,067</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">Financial Health Score</p>
              <p class="num-mono text-lg font-bold text-white">86 / 100</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary italic">
            "With the Digital Financial Passport, my community credit society saw my genuine cashflow consistency in minutes and approved my tea boiler upgrade."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#16181D] border border-[#22252B] rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-card-subtle">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-[#22252B]">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Underwriting Dossier</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Ramesh Kumar</p>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-full bg-positive/10 text-positive border border-positive/20">
              ELIGIBLE
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="py-4 space-y-3 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Cashflow Volatility (CV):</span>
              <span class="num-mono font-bold text-white">0.043 (Ultra-Stable)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Debt-to-Surplus Ratio:</span>
              <span class="num-mono font-bold text-white">15.9%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">ML Repayment Confidence:</span>
              <span class="num-mono font-bold text-lime">78.2% (Tier 1 Low Risk)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">SHAP Prime Strength:</span>
              <span class="font-medium text-white">High Receipt Consistency (+0.858)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#22252B]">
            <a href="/dashboard" class="w-full btn-lime text-xs py-2.5 flex items-center justify-center">
              View Ramesh's Full Assessment ➔
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
